[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11161.75, "timestamp": "03:06:01", "text": "。 上传速度目前是 10。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11165.429, "timestamp": "03:06:05", "text": "有时候，你知道，在网络状况良好的时候，速度可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11171.429, "timestamp": "03:06:11", "text": "达到 20。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11176.79, "timestamp": "03:06:16", "text": "是的，因为 OBS 会占用 6 个 MP"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11179.19, "timestamp": "03:06:19", "text": "，剩下的 MP 会被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11182.87, "timestamp": "03:06:22", "text": "游戏占用。 感觉有点太多了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11186.07, "timestamp": "03:06:26", "text": "然后我的室友会用他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11190.55, "timestamp": "03:06:30", "text": "手机，或者看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11195.429, "timestamp": "03:06:35", "text": "电影、动漫，或者用他的MacBook工作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11198.23, "timestamp": "03:06:38", "text": "或者做其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11200.71, "timestamp": "03:06:40", "text": "会消耗网络流量的事情，这样就会出现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11203.99, "timestamp": "03:06:43", "text": "网络限速。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11210.55, "timestamp": "03:06:50", "text": "我脑子里想的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11215.83, "timestamp": "03:06:55", "text": "如果我能自己组装第二台电脑，那该多好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11217.67, "timestamp": "03:06:57", "text": "啊？"}]